trigaserver (0.0.2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial Debian packaging.
  * Ship Sphinx HTML documentation in /usr/share/doc/trigaserver/html.
  * Serve that documentation with a dedicated Apache instance on port
    8080 (trigaserver-doc.service).
  * Enable and start trigaserver.service on install.
  * Install and enable trigaserver-doc.service via dh_installsystemd --name.

